                    <p class=MsoNormal>
                        <b>
                            <span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">
                                <font face="仿宋">是否使用教材：</font>
                            </span>
                        </b>
                        <b>
                            <span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">
                                <font face="仿宋">☑ 是（若使用教材，请填写以下教材信息，原则上教材数量不宜超过2本。）</font>
                            </span>
                        </b>
                    </p>
